# Blighting the creature the Hex itself targets: the -1/-1 counter makes Bot1's Llanowar Elves a 0/0, which dies to the state-based action
# after the cast (CR 704.5f, 701.68a), so the Hex's only target is illegal as it would resolve and it does not resolve (CR 608.2b): the
# additional cost was paid, but "you gain 2 life" is part of the spell's effect, so no life is gained. Compare
# "...blight-kills-a-one-toughness-creature-and-the-spell-still-resolves", where the target is another creature.

